# An allowlist, not a denylist. data/ holds a 475MB CSV and a 1.84GB graph
# cache; a missed pattern would put either into the build context and every
# build would crawl. Everything is excluded, then the image's actual inputs are
# named back in.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

!agent
!api
!ml
!rag
!scripts
!config.py
!db.py
!artifacts.py

# 122KB checkpoint (section 2: the model artifact is baked) and 97KB of seed
# data. The 1.84GB graph is deliberately absent -- AML_GRAPH_S3, see artifacts.py.
!artifacts/model-HI-Small_Trans.pt
!data/seed

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
